<title>DENMARK: Codan sees 97 result similar to 96.</title>
<headline>Codan sees 97 result similar to 96.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish insurer Codan on Thursday said that it expected 1997 profits, excluding changes in securities values, to be similar to those in 1996.</p>
<p>The company announced a rise in pre-tax profit for 1996 to 968 million crowns, from 1995's 741 million.</p>
